  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.45 “Emergency medical service vehicle” means “emergency medical service vehicle” as defined in RSA 153-A:2, X. The term includes “vehicle”.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
